; D7-exec runtime failure: the manifest binds `(kaboom n)` to
; `:impl "wasm:fail"`. Plugin returns an `ok=0` frame carrying code
; `domain` + detail "plugin reported a structured failure"; the host
; bridge passes the frame through and the Zig invoker surfaces
; `plugin_func_failed` at the call span. Skipped on Zig-native +
; TS-parity (no wasm runtime).
(use-plugin "double")

(kaboom 1)
